- [ ] **Physical Standalone Hardware Verification**: Install `tutorkeybox.service` on Raspberry Pi 5 system, test cold power-up without display/Mac, and verify real-time audio playback.
- [ ] **Optimize Booting Time for under 15s**: Streamline Pi 5 kernel/firmware EEPROM initialization and systemd service ordering to achieve <15s cold boot to audio playback.

### Section 4: Build System & Compilation Overhead Cleanup
- [x] **Strip Graphics from Command-Line Utilities**: Removed `juce_graphics` and `juce_gui_basics` dependencies from `TKBPackager` command-line tool.
